Here we have a yellowtail sashimi with ponzu sauce and pea shoots. This is carpaccio with shaved white truffles. And, finally, an heirloom tomato salad with fresh Buratta flown in from Italy this morning.
ໃນອັນນີ້ພວກເຮົາມີ sashimi yellowtail ກັບໂຊສ ponzu ແລະຜັກກາດ, ນີ້ແມ່ນ carpaccio ກັບ truffles
ຂາວ shaved, ແລະ, ສຸດທ້າຍ, salad tomato heirloom ກັບ Buratta ສົດບິນມາຈາກອີຕາລີໃນຕອນເຊົ້ານີ້.

653
00:40:35,350 --> 00:40:37,350
[STAN]
Thanks, Sam. It looks incredible.
ຂອບໃຈ, ແຊມ ມັນເບິ່ງບໍ່ຫນ້າເຊື່ອ

654
00:40:37,850 --> 00:40:39,850
[STAN]
Aren't you hungry?
ເຈົ້າຫິວບໍ່?

655
